                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "1916199a-f00c-48d0-87ce-5281316fd011",
                        "entry_id": "fef0ff57-b393-3718-bcd8-168db16d686d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "stéatopyges"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "37ba61e1-50b5-3bda-92b8-e96e894ac7f6",
                        "entry_id": "fef0ff57-b393-3718-bcd8-168db16d686d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui a de très grosses fesses."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "819b95a1-3e22-4df1-8ff3-cbb7ee1c08ad",
                                "sense_id": "37ba61e1-50b5-3bda-92b8-e96e894ac7f6",
                                "text": "La forme la plus naïve de cette exigence, c'est l'idéal hottentot de la Vénus stéatopyge, les fesses étant la partie du corps la moins innervée, celle où la chair apparaît comme un donné sans destination."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "37ee41c8-59df-4797-aa7b-4176ecb75e06",
                                "sense_id": "37ba61e1-50b5-3bda-92b8-e96e894ac7f6",
                                "text": "Gunnar entra dans mon bureau et me trouva en contemplation devant une planche représentant une mère stéatopyge et sa fille. Les femmes bochimanes se caractérisent en effet par un développement exagéré des cellules adipeuses du fessier. ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9beb5206-15fd-4bc2-b167-1c68c3a39d5f",
                                "sense_id": "37ba61e1-50b5-3bda-92b8-e96e894ac7f6",
                                "text": "En effet les Vénus stéatopyges (aux fesses grasses) furent les premières divinités (ayant visages humains) de l'histoire de l'humanité (voir aussi les statuettes aurignaciennes stéatopyges)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "14a9b3c1-fbdb-4805-acca-f0dba6e7b36b",
                        "source_entry_id": "fef0ff57-b393-3718-bcd8-168db16d686d",
                        "source_sense_id": "37ba61e1-50b5-3bda-92b8-e96e894ac7f6",
                        "target_lang_word": "steatopygous",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "steatopygous",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b2324a72-d6d7-33c4-91f1-e7a8198ef8db",
                                        "entry_id": "fb695866-775a-3778-9566-e3d6491d9149",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to steatopygia; having fat or prominent buttocks."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d95463f-0259-41af-8a06-99471f3e6b01",
                                                "sense_id": "b2324a72-d6d7-33c4-91f1-e7a8198ef8db",
                                                "text": "At his side, Amuta and a steatopygous twelve-year-old in a striped shift."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "514dd850-2fa7-4818-9007-8667abcb5b86",
                                                "sense_id": "b2324a72-d6d7-33c4-91f1-e7a8198ef8db",
                                                "text": "[W]e may refer to some unknown condition of climate, the steatopygous deformities of the Bushmen. As these remarkable depositions of fat are not the peculiarity of one tribe, namely the Saabs, [...] we have no room for doubt that the cause of the phenomenon is some influence connected with climate and situation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6959844-84b0-4e56-92a3-1aadb71afdab",
                                                "sense_id": "b2324a72-d6d7-33c4-91f1-e7a8198ef8db",
                                                "text": "Living in rooms opposite these slave girls, and seeing them at all hours of the day and night, I had frequent opportunities of studying them. They were average specimens of the steatopygous Abyssinian breed, broad-shouldered, thin-flanked, fine-limbed, and with haunches of prodigious size."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "413d0ef4-2ddd-40bf-b854-22a35798fad9",
                                                "sense_id": "b2324a72-d6d7-33c4-91f1-e7a8198ef8db",
                                                "text": "Perhaps, he now felt, if this body he held could become—just for twenty or thirty seconds—one of those harem dreams of his, pampered, pouting, perfumed, steatopygous, he could, he was sure, achieve what it was a plain duty, apart from all questions of gratification, to achieve."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b26af14a-13d5-441c-96ea-b77f2f091b47",
                                                "sense_id": "b2324a72-d6d7-33c4-91f1-e7a8198ef8db",
                                                "text": "And finally there is the old crone of death, the steatopygous figure with pointed feet, that goes all the way back to the Paleolithic settlement of Dolne Vestonice."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
